---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Mehdi Azarmi" current="about">
  <main class="prose-page">
    <p class="kicker">~/about</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:30px;margin:8px 0">About</h1>
    <img
      src="/img/profile.png"
      alt="Mehdi Azarmi"
      width="120"
      height="120"
      style="border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)"
    />
    <p>
      I received my Ph.D. in Computer Science from Purdue University. I was
      affiliated with the Center for Education and Research in Information
      Assurance and Security (CERIAS).
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm currently interested in designing reliable and massively scalable
      distributed systems. In my current project, I'm working on a real-time,
      scalable, and resilient stream processing ecosystem.
    </p>
    <p>
      Previously, I've worked on distributed software-defined storage and
      multiple areas of information security.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
